### 11. Save RETRIEVAL run (to test non-comparable kind boundary SLHD_EVAL_00006) — expects 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/eval/runs
Content-Type: application/json
X-Eval-Token: {{evalToken}}

{
  "run_id": "{{runRetrieval}}",
  "kind": "RETRIEVAL",
  "started_at": "2026-11-26T12:20:00Z",
  "finished_at": "2026-11-26T12:21:00Z",
